:: StoryInit
<<set $health = 10>>
<<set $maxHealth = 10>>
<<set $time = "Evening">>
<<run setup.Game.bootstrap()>>


:: StoryCaption
<div id="framework-sidebar"></div>


:: The Tavern
<h2>The Tavern Entrance</h2>

You find yourself in a modest roadside tavern.

The room smells of smoke, spilled ale, and wet wool.

<<link "Approach the bar">><<run setup.GameUI.moveHuman("bar")>><</link>><br>
<<link "Look at the other patrons">><<run setup.GameUI.moveHuman("commonRoom")>><</link>><br>
<<link "Step outside">><<run setup.GameUI.moveHuman("street")>><</link>>


:: The Bar
<h2>The Bar</h2>

The innkeeper wipes a wooden mug with a cloth that has probably seen better days.

"What can I get you?"

[[Speak with the innkeeper->Innkeeper Close-up]]<br>
[[Order an ale->Drink Ale]]<br>
[[Ask about recent news->Ask for News]]<br>
<<link "Return to the entrance">><<run setup.GameUI.moveHuman("tavernEntrance")>><</link>>


:: Innkeeper Close-up
<h2>The Innkeeper</h2>

The innkeeper looks up from his work and waits for you to speak.

[[Step back from the bar->The Bar]]


:: The Common Room
<h2>The Common Room</h2>

Several travellers sit near the fire.

A hooded woman watches the entrance. Two merchants argue quietly over a map.

[[Approach the hooded woman->Hooded Woman]]<br>
[[Listen to the merchants->Merchants]]<br>
<<link "Return to the entrance">><<run setup.GameUI.moveHuman("tavernEntrance")>><</link>>


:: Hooded Woman
<h2>The Hooded Woman</h2>

As you approach, the woman turns slightly toward you. Her face remains hidden beneath the hood.

[[Step away from the woman->The Common Room]]


:: Merchants
<h2>The Merchants</h2>

The merchants lower their voices when they notice you listening.

[[Return to the common room->The Common Room]]


:: The Street
<h2>The Street</h2>

Cold rain falls upon the empty village street.

The tavern's windows glow warmly behind you.

<<link "Return to the tavern">><<run setup.GameUI.moveHuman("tavernEntrance")>><</link>>


:: Drink Ale
<h2>Order an Ale</h2>

The deterministic framework does not implement buying and selling yet. The mug on the bar can still be taken, dropped, or handed to another character through the action interface below.

[[Return to the bar->The Bar]]


:: Ask for News
<h2>Ask for News</h2>

The innkeeper has no scripted or AI response yet. He is currently controlled by DummyController and therefore takes no action.

[[Return to the bar->The Bar]]
